      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING OSAKA (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from four tries. In the money last time at this track (23.15) in a Grade 5, finishing a nose second. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. REMISSION RUN (2) showed good early burn but run over late to finish 7th at Taree Super Track in Grade 5 company. Cannot be underestimated. HEY ZIPPER (8) improved her time on first attempt this course and distance with a 11 length win in 22.71 here latest. Harder here but expected to feature again. LARRIKIN PIONEER (7) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
